2026-07-28T16:52:04.0711603Z i /tmp/RtmpnbrtA8/duckdb
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0711940Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0712312Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0712649Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0713174Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0713931Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T16:52:04.0714509Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
